930
00:41:26.810 --> 00:41:28.970
I mean, there's just a bunch of boring tables.

931
00:41:29.290 --> 00:41:29.630
Yeah.

932
00:41:30.070 --> 00:41:30.610
Oh, wait.

933
00:41:30.690 --> 00:41:32.090
One has a ton of balloons.

934
00:41:33.330 --> 00:41:36.970
And nice of the restaurant to let them hang a banner in their potted plants.

935
00:41:36.970 --> 00:41:37.810
I know.

936
00:41:38.250 --> 00:41:39.950
It is so sweet.

937
00:41:40.210 --> 00:41:44.110
Michael has completely decorated this table for Helene's birthday.

938
00:41:44.930 --> 00:41:45.810
Pam notices.

939
00:41:45.810 --> 00:41:49.430
I think this is the first moment where she's kind of softening to this.

