00:42:07.990 --> 00:42:08.650
Not interested.

949
00:42:09.110 --> 00:42:10.190
And he's like, great.

950
00:42:10.490 --> 00:42:12.530
I guess I'll take your books.

951
00:42:12.790 --> 00:42:16.470
And then Pam and her mom have this, like, fun little banter.

952
00:42:16.730 --> 00:42:19.450
Pam's like, so, Mom, which birthday are we celebrating this year?

953
00:42:19.930 --> 00:42:21.730
Jenna, I used to do this with my mom.

954
00:42:22.150 --> 00:42:23.010
What do you mean?

955
00:42:23.250 --> 00:42:25.370
I would be like, okay, Mom, what birthday is it?

956
00:42:25.430 --> 00:42:27.630
And for years, my mom said 32.

957
00:42:28.350 --> 00:42:28.750
Really?

958
00:42:29.330 --> 00:42:29.750
32.

959
