00:42:40.490 --> 00:42:42.010
Michael's like, ha-ha, that's funny.

964
00:42:42.090 --> 00:42:43.970
But you can see him trying to do the math.

965
00:42:44.190 --> 00:42:46.750
But then he's going to need to take pencil to paper.

966
00:42:47.150 --> 00:42:48.590
And still get it wrong.

967
00:42:48.810 --> 00:42:49.130
Right.

968
